      <Output>
        <ErrorInfo>
          <Message>this file validates token lifetime but never names JwtValidationDefaults.ClockSkew. With no ClockSkew set, Microsoft.IdentityModel applies its own default of FIVE MINUTES — silently looser than every other validator in this system:
services/Diten.HumanCapitalService/src/Diten.HumanCapitalService.Api/Program.cs
services/Diten.TalentEcosystemService/src/Diten.TalentEcosystemService.Api/Program.cs</Message>
